# proto-file: protowire/schema/v1/descriptor.proto
# proto-message: protowire.schema.v1.AnnotationList
#
# Golden lowered annotation carrier (RFC-001 §8.1) covering all Literal
# variants (issues #64, #176):
#   - a linker-RESOLVED enum-value reference (EnumLiteral),
#   - a typed message literal (google.protobuf.Any, serialized at
#     lowering; here fixtures.literals.Money{currency: "USD", units: 5},
#     whose wire bytes are "\n\003USD\020\005"),
#   - a homogeneous scalar list literal (LiteralValue elements — values,
#     not arguments: no names, no expressions),
#   - a homogeneous list of typed message literals (each element a
#     LiteralValue.literal wrapping Literal.message, its own Any
#     serialized at lowering; trendvidia/protocompile#127).
# Cross-port conformance: lowering the use sites in 10_literal_args.proto
# (all four source forms, per the §5.1 literal grammar / issue #102)
# must produce a semantically equal carrier. The fixture writes every
# argument positionally, so AnnotationArg.name is empty throughout
# (§8.1: "empty for positional"); location.file is the fixture's import
# path, line/column the use site's `@` token.
#
# The Numeric / SpelledFloat / SpelledInt entries pin §8.1 "Choosing the
# member" (issue #262): the member is decided by the annotated element's
# type — an integer-spelled 42 on a double is double_value 42, 1e19 on a
# double is double_value, a list on repeated double converts each element
# — and, with no element type (a message-level annotation), by the
# literal's own spelling. cmd/pxf/literal_carrier_test.go compares this
# file with what the reference lowers from 10_literal_args.proto, in
# fixture order: each message's own entries, then its fields'.

entries {
  name: "fixtures.literals.sample"
  args {
    literal {
      enum_value {
        enum_type: "fixtures.literals.OrderStatus"
        value_name: "CANCELLED"
        number: 3
      }
    }
  }
  location { file: "10_literal_args.proto" line: 58 column: 5 }
}
entries {
  name: "fixtures.literals.sample"
  args {
    literal {
      message {
        type_url: "type.googleapis.com/fixtures.literals.Money"
        value: "\n\003USD\020\005"
      }
    }
  }
  location { file: "10_literal_args.proto" line: 63 column: 5 }
}
entries {
  name: "fixtures.literals.allowed"
  args {
    literal {
      list {
        elements { string_value: "US" }
        elements { string_value: "CA" }
        elements { string_value: "GB" }
      }
    }
  }
  location { file: "10_literal_args.proto" line: 67 column: 5 }
}
